This pull request contains `_.pascalCase` static function.

``` js
_.pascalCase('Foo Bar');
// => 'FooBar'

_.pascalCase('--foo-bar');
// => 'FooBar'

_.pascalCase('__foo_bar__');
// => 'FooBar'
```

